# Language Specification

In this chapter we will learn about

- Scanner Commands
- Language keywords
- Alias Keywords
- Language Functions
- Compiler Errors
- Runtime Errors
- Environment Errors
- Language Grammar
- Virtual Machine (VM) Instructions

# Scanner Commands

Commands Count: 5

- ChangeRingKeyword
- ChangeRingOperator
- DisableHashComments
- EnableHashComments
- LoadSyntax

Grammar:

```ring
Command ---> 'changeringkeyword' <OldKeyword> <NewKeyword>
Command ---> 'changeringoperator' <OldOperator> <NewOperator>
Command ---> 'EnableHashComments'
Command ---> 'DisableHashComments'
Command ---> 'loadsyntax' <Literal>
```


