15 538 1024
functions.md_c2
[Functions, Parameters & Scopes > Functions, Parameters & Scopes (cont.)]

Example:

```ring
x = 10     # global variable

func main {
    for t = 1 to 10 {
        mycounter()
    }
}

func mycounter {
    see x + nl
    x--
}
```

# Return Value

Functions return values using the `return` command:

```ring
func add x, y {
    return x + y
}
```

# Recursion

Functions support recursive calls:

```ring
see fact(5)      # output = 120

func fact x {
    if x = 0 {
        return 1
    else
        return x * fact(x - 1)
    }
}
```

