ring_syntax_pitfalls_session.md_c3
[Syntax Pitfalls & Style 3 Traps > ## 2. try/catch needs a `done` terminator in brace-style]

- `try { } catch { }` → Compiler **C14** "Try/Catch miss the Catch keyword".
- Correct:
```ring
try {
    a = sysargs()
catch
    see "no sysargs: " + cCatchError + nl
}
done
```


