| **Lists (1-based)**| `len(a)`, `add(a, v)`, `del(a, idx)`, `insert(a, idx, v)`, `find(a, v)`, `sort(a)`, `reverse(a)`, `binarysearch(a, v)`, `list(rows, cols)` |
