SKILL.md_c10
[Ring 1.27 Fast Cheatsheet > ### 1. Conditionals — `else` / `elseif` INSIDE the closing `}`]

```ring
if condition {
    # block
else
    # block
}

if condition {
    # block
elseif condition2
    # block
else
    # block
}
```
> ⚠️ **CRITICAL TRAP:** NEVER write `} else {`. In Ring's parser, closing `}` before `else` detaches it from the `if`, producing **Runtime Error R24** (`Using uninitialized variable: else`).


