[Ring 1.27 Fast Cheatsheet > ### 5. Error Handling (`try / catch / done`)]

```ring
try {
    # risky operation
catch
    see "Error caught: " + cCatchError + nl
}
done
```
> In brace-style, `try { ... } catch ... }` MUST conclude with the `done` keyword.

