FSTRINGS.md_c4
[Madar Feature: F-Strings > ## 3. Nested f-strings]


Madar supports up to 8 levels of nested `f-strings`:

```ring
status = "ready"
code = 200
msg = f"System Report: { f'Status is {status} (HTTP {code})' }"
see msg # System Report: Status is ready (HTTP 200)
```

