[Madar Feature: List Comprehensions > ## 7. Nested Comprehensions (2D Matrices)]


Comprehensions can be nested inside other comprehensions:

```ring
matrix = [[r * c for c in 1:3] for r in 1:3]
# Result:
# [
#   [1, 2, 3],
#   [2, 4, 6],
#   [3, 6, 9]
# ]
