COMPREHENSIONS.md_c10
[Madar Feature: List Comprehensions > ## 8. Multi-Line Formatting]


Comprehensions support clean multi-line formatting across line boundaries:

```ring
data = [
    x * 3
    for x in 1:10
    if x > 3
    if x < 8
]
# Result: [12, 15, 18, 21]
```

