COMPREHENSIONS.md_c11
[Madar Feature: List Comprehensions > ## 9. Slicing with Comprehensions]


Since list comprehensions are first-class expressions, you can directly slice them:

```ring
top_three = [x * 10 for x in 1:10][1:3]
# Result: [10, 20, 30]
```

