16 309 1024
DOUR_LOOPS.md_c4
[Madar Feature: Dour Loop Optimization > ### A. Numerical Range Loops]


```ring
# Sum of squares computed natively with Auto-JIT
nSum = 0
dour x = 1 to 1000000
    nSum += (x * x)
next

see "Sum = " + nSum + nl
```

Full support for step increments:
```ring
dour i = 10 to 1 step -1
    see i + nl
next
```


