SLICING.md_c4
[Madar Feature: Advanced Python Slicing > ## 3. Step / Stride (`step`)]


You can specify a step interval by adding a second colon `:step`:

```ring
s = "Hello World"
? s[::2]     # "HloWrd"
? s[1:5:2]   # "Hlo"

nums = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50]
? nums[::2]     # [10, 30, 50]
? nums[1:5:2]   # [10, 30, 50]
```

