SLICING.md_c7
[Madar Feature: Advanced Python Slicing > ## 6. Chained Slicing & Expressions]


Slices can be chained or contain dynamic expressions:

```ring
# Expressions in slices:
a = 1
b = 3
? nums[a + 1 : b + 1] # [20, 30, 40]

# Chained slicing:
? "abcdefgh"[2:7][2:4] # "cd"
? nums[1:4][2:3]       # [20, 30]
```

